{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303135","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303135","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1430313501:0":{"text":"でも、フェリルは賢者の血筋なんだから！陛下だって、あんなことはしちゃいけないよ。","source_cn":"但斐利尔是贤者的后代！即使是女王要处死斐利尔也不能这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BD4F3BA36DF53A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430313502:0":{"text":"しかも、フェリルは上級司祭なんだよ！最年少の！","source_cn":"而且斐利尔还是高级祭司！整个萨洛克兰最年轻的那位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07B3457F7207DE82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430313503:0":{"text":"納得できない……こんなの、信じたくないよ。","source_cn":"这太不合理了……我，我还是不敢相信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE70F872A40B236D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小贵族伊丽":{"text":"下級貴族のイリィ","source":"小贵族伊丽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小贵族凯顿":{"text":"下級貴族のケイトン","source":"小贵族凯顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}